        {"number":1,"text":"附录 常见问题","bounds":{"page":2,"x":68.044,"y":73.162,"w":13.090004,"h":85.45601},"fontSize":14.0,"heading":true},
        {"number":2,"text":"问：同步失败时应该怎么办？","bounds":{"page":2,"x":92.068,"y":97.116,"w":11.363998,"h":148.416},"fontSize":12.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":3,"text":"答：请先检查网络连接，然后在设置页面中点击“立即同步”。如果仍然失败，请重新登录账号。","bounds":{"page":2,"x":111.208,"y":72.504,"w":30.864006,"h":407.016},"fontSize":12.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":4,"text":"问：一个账号可以在几台设备上使用？","bounds":{"page":2,"x":149.716,"y":97.116,"w":11.304001,"h":196.41599},"fontSize":12.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":5,"text":"答：每个账号最多可以在五台设备上同时使用。","bounds":{"page":2,"x":168.892,"y":96.444,"w":11.328003,"h":243.72},"fontSize":12.0,"heading":false}
